---
description: >-
  Every arrow type with `autonumber both`, in both directions. Arrowheads have
  to stay visible next to the receiver number, and on reverse half-arrows the
  lower number goes on the tail.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber both
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  Alice->>Bob: Solid
  Bob-->>Alice: Dotted
  Alice->Bob: Open
  Bob-->Alice: Open dotted
  Alice-xBob: Cross
  Bob--xAlice: Cross dotted
  Alice-)Bob: Async
  Bob--)Alice: Async dotted
  Alice<<->>Bob: Bidirectional
  Bob<<-->>Alice: Bidirectional dotted
  Alice-|\Bob: Half top
  Bob-|/Alice: Half bottom
  Alice-\\Bob: Stick top
  Bob-//Alice: Stick bottom
  Alice/|-Bob: Reverse top
  Bob\|-Alice: Reverse bottom
  Alice//-Bob: Reverse stick top
  Bob\\-Alice: Reverse stick bottom
  Alice/|--Bob: Reverse top dotted
